:: Foregrounds [widget]
<<widget "foregrounds">>
	<div class="settingsGrid">
		<div class="settingsHeader options">Foregrounds</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItemWide">
				<span class="green">Foregrounds will display an image on the top layer of the screen. To add a foreground, go into the foreground folder in the img folder and replace the number you want to use.</span>
				<br><br>
				<span class="gold">Foreground Overlay Options:</span><br>
					<label>Foreground 1 <<radiovar "$foreground" "1">><<updatesidebarimg>><</radiovar>></label> |
